Suggests: mythicos-sources
Description: MythicOS Update Manager
 Shows and installs the software and security updates (APT and Flatpak)
 available for MythicOS, and tells when a new version of MythicOS can be
 installed. It is based on code from the Linux Mint Update Manager and the
 Ubuntu Update Manager.
